# Meal.OS Project Guide

## Overview

Meal.OS is an AI meal operating system for Indian households. It combines planning, household rules, cook handoff, and shopping support in one product flow.

## Tech Stack

- Backend: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, SQLite
- Frontend: Next.js App Router, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript
- AI: Azure OpenAI
- TTS: Azure Speech

## Project Structure

- `backend/` API, models, services, seed data, backend tests
- `frontend/` app routes, UI components, API client, frontend tests
- `docs/` public documentation and assets

## Conventions

- Keep product framing consistent with `Meal.OS`
- Avoid private or household-identifying real-world details in public-facing files
- Treat the strongest demo path as `home -> check-in -> plans -> cook brief`
- Prefer test-first changes when behavior changes
